    "statement": "theorem small_characteristic_j_certificate : (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [IsAlgClosed K] [CharP K 2] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) [W.IsElliptic], Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion W)=(if W.j=0 then 1 else 2) ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 2) (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion W)=(if W.j=0 then 0 else 1) ∧ (W.j=0 ↔ ∀ P : W.Point,(2:ℕ) • P=0 → P=0)) ∧ (∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [IsAlgClosed K] [CharP K 3] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) [W.IsElliptic], Nat.card (ThreeTorsion W)=(if W.j=0 then 1 else 3) ∧ Module.finrank (ZMod 3) (ThreeTorsion W)=(if W.j=0 then 0 else 1) ∧ (W.j=0 ↔ ∀ P : W.Point,(3:ℕ) • P=0 → P=0)) ∧ (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] [CharP F 2] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F) [W.IsElliptic], Nat.card (TwoTorsionRankAudit.TwoTorsion (W.baseChange L))=(if W.j=0 then 1 else 2)) ∧ (∀ (F L : Type) [Field F] [Field L] [Algebra F L] [DecidableEq F] [DecidableEq L] [IsAlgClosed L] [CharP F 3] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine F) [W.IsElliptic], Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (W.baseChange L))=(if W.j=0 then 1 else 3)) ∧ (finiteControl.Δ=1 ∧ finiteControl.j=1 ∧ Nat.card finiteControl.Point=5 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion finiteControl)=1 ∧ Nat.card (ThreeTorsion (finiteControl.baseChange ControlClosure))=3 ∧ ¬(finiteControl.j=0 ↔ ∀ P : finiteControl.Point,(3:ℕ) • P=0 → P=0)) ∧ (¬∀ (K : Type) [Field K] [DecidableEq K] [CharP K 3] (W : WeierstrassCurve.Affine K) [W.IsElliptic], W.j=0 ↔ ∀ P : W.Point,(3:ℕ) • P=0 → P=0)",
    "decl_sha256": "98419caefca68cee87b4b05877c487f114829cfaa65fde94214040844b727f97",
    "scope": "Actual geometric p-torsion/Mathlibj criteria in characteristics2and3 for every nonsingular generalWeierstrassmodel. Over everyalgclosedfieldcharp, actualkilledp subgroupcard1ifj0elsep, actualinducedZModpfinrank0ifj0else1, j0iffallactualkilledppointsidentity. EverybasefieldF/actualalgebraicembeddingintoalgclosedL hasactualscalar-extensiontorsioncountdeterminedbybasej. Char3literalPsi3=b2x³+b8 plusactualDelta/invariantrelation provescoefficientclassification; actualnonzeropointconstructedwhenb2nonzero, no rank/basis/normalform/pairing premise. OfficialMathlibj0coefficientidentities/oldchar2geometry/generalchar3cardclassification credited. ConcreteF3curve y²=x³+2x²+1 actualDelta1/j1/#points5/rational3torsioncard1/geometric3torsioncard3; directuniversalnegationafterdeletingalgclosedhypothesis. No qualifiedsource/p>=5node refutation, Endrank/p-rank/traceidentification/Hasse/embeddingdegree theorem, otherprime/fullallkp500/all14completion, fullbookread/novelty/corpuspromotion/nativeexperiment/spend/upload.",
